{"name":"The Verifier Set","short_name":"Verifier Set","start_url":"./","display":"standalone","background_color":"#02070c","theme_color":"#02070c","icons":[{"src":"icon.svg","sizes":"any","type":"image/svg+xml"}],"description":"A small AI reads documents, writes rules and claims, and works out answers in your browser. Four checks, one for each kind of work: a cited figure must be in the document, a formula must pass its rule's tests, a claim is decided by a solver, a step is checked by exact arithmetic. Every answer says how true it is."}
